      "writtenOn": "2023-02-14T05:15:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So a while ago, I introduced a bug because I forgot to call .await. The previous pattern was:\n```\nlet _ \u003d txl.send(...).await;\n```\n\nThis doesn\u0027t protect you from failing to call await. The new pattern (requiring an Option\u003c()\u003e type) will protect you from failure to call `.await` and also not add the `unused result` warning.",
